# What the sandbox build does not need.
#
# The deploy runs from the repo root, because sandbox/ui is a workspace package
# and its dependencies are built from source. That would otherwise upload the
# whole company: strategy, the planning documents have no part
# in building a component sandbox, so they do not leave the machine.
# Leading slash matters: `docs/` is a gitignore-style pattern and would also
# match `cortex/docs` and `helix/docs`, which are workspace members. Excluding
# those breaks `bun install` before the build starts.
/docs/

# Build output and scratch, rebuilt on Vercel anyway.
.claude/
.local/
target/
**/.next/
**/.turbo/
**/dist/
**/node_modules/

# Rust, which nothing in this project builds.
Cargo.lock
Cargo.toml
